@startuml admin-users-list
!include admin-common.puml
title Gestion des utilisateurs - Liste

== Gestion des utilisateurs ==
Admin -> Frontend: Modérer utilisateurs
Frontend -> API: GET /api/admin/users
note right
Query: ?status=flagged&role=USER&page=1
end note
API -> Auth: Vérifier permissions admin
Auth --> API: access granted

API -> AdminCtrl: getUsers(filters)
AdminCtrl -> UserSvc: getUsers(filters, pagination)
UserSvc -> DB: SELECT users WITH last_login, order_count WHERE filters
DB --> UserSvc: users list
UserSvc --> AdminCtrl: paginated users
AdminCtrl --> API: users data
API --> Frontend: users list
Frontend --> Admin: Liste utilisateurs avec actions

@enduml